'''Atomic-X'''{{Refn|[[:File:Atomic-X Concept Art.png]]|group = ca}}{{Refn|[[:File:000 B10 52 RetakeAtomicXAttacksVilgax Sheet.png]]|group = still}}<ref name="ATTWB" /> also spelled as '''Atomix X'''{{Refn| [[:File:The End of an Era Voice Credits (1).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name="ATTWB" /> is the [[Combinations (Classic)|combination]] of [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]] and [[Atomix]]'s DNA. He can only be accessed by using the [[Biomnitrix]].

==Appearance==
Atomic-X greatly bears the body similar to [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]]. His arms have large green cylinders filled with energy and orbs on his shoulders. His eyebrows take the shape of Alien X's horns. He has the basic characteristics of [[Atomix]], including his upper torso, collarbone, lower jaw, waist, thighs and feet as well as sharing the same height of Atomix.

Atomic-X wears the [[Biomnitrix]] symbol on his chest.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
TWB (570).png|Enhanced Strength
TEoaE (507).png|Atomic Blasts
TWB (566).png|Teleportation
TWB (541).png|Black Hole Generation
ATTWN (466).png|Enhanced Jumping
</gallery>
As a combination, Atomic-X circumvents the need for [[Serena]] and [[Bellicus]],{{Refn|[[:File:Atomic-X Overrides Alien X's Personalities.png]]|group = DJW}} allowing [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] to use a [[Celestialsapien (Classic)|Celestialsapien]]'s reality warping powers without debating.{{Refn|group = DJW|name = powers}}{{Refn|group = note|name = omnipotence}}

Atomic-X has an extremely high level of enhanced strength, capable of knocking [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] into the air with a mere flick of a finger.<ref name="ATTWB">''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref>

Being part-Celestialsapien, Atomic-X can teleport anywhere he wishes.<ref name="ATTWB" />

Similar to [[Atomix]], Atomic-X can shoot energy beams from his fists.<ref name="TEoaE">''[[The End of an Era]]''</ref>

Atomic-X can create multiple orbs that appear to be combinations of light combinations and black holes without physically doing anything.<ref name="ATTWB" />

Atomic-X can jump incredibly high in the air.<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref>

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
ATTWN (472).png|Vulnerability to Chronosapien Time Bomb
TEoaE (514).png|Vulnerability to Time Rays
</gallery>
Atomic-X can be destroyed by a [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]].<ref name="ATTWN" />

Atomic-X is vulnerable to time attacks of a [[Chronosapien]].<ref name="TEoaE" />

Atomic-X is weaker than [[Alien X (Classic)|Alien X]], as his DNA is diluted due to being a combination.{{Refn|group = DR|name = diluted}}

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Atomic-X first appeared in ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', where he tried to stop the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]] but failed and was erased from existence.
*In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', Atomic-X was brought back to existence by [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] as [[Clockwork]]. Later, Atomic-X helped the good Bens defeat [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].

===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*In ''[[The End of an Era]]'', Atomic-X battled [[Maltruant]] but was defeated in order to save [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Spanner]].

